# The optional VGGT environment (/opt/vggt, docker/Dockerfile.vggt): the vggt step runs in it, the
# rest of the app in /opt/venv. Separate because PyTorch needs NVIDIA's CUDA 13 pip packages and the
# GPU build of COLMAP in /opt/venv the CUDA 12 ones (both named cuda-toolkit). Here COLMAP is the CPU
# build (VGGT only writes cameras with it). Same versions as /opt/venv where they overlap. Locked by:
#   uv pip compile docker/requirements-vggt.in -o docker/requirements-vggt.txt \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_39
